  triage:title "baselines.json skeleton revision key never read/validated; no monotonic-floor enforcement" ;
  triage:description "site/reports/read-query-benchmark/baselines.json declares a revision key that scripts/smoke/read_benchmark.py never reads or validates, and there is no non-decreasing-floor enforcement analogous to the existing require_non_decreasing_baselines(). Expected to be subsumed by the AV4-B1 rework onto benchmark_schema BaselineSet/BaselineEntry, which already carries revision/provenance and monotonic checks." ;
